    """
    Adds "number_to_add" to the current "remaining" amount.
    If there is enough remaining to cover the entire number_to_add,
    subtract number_to_add from remaining and return (number_to_add, new_remaining).
    If not enough, take all remaining, set remaining to 0, and return (original_remaining, 0).
    """
